OL,3,AVigil held for family who died in sea
OL,4,Aoff Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe community in Shoreham, West Sussex,
OL,7,Fhas paid its respects to a family who
OL,8,Fdied after getting into difficulty in
OL,9,Fthe sea on Tuesday.
OL,11,FHassan El-Khawas, 55, Zeina Alayn, 37,
OL,12,Fand their 14-year-old daughter Sara,
OL,13,Fdied despite the efforts of paramedics
OL,14,Fat the scene. It was confirmed on
OL,15,FFriday that six-year-old Saja El-Khawas
OL,16,Fhad died in hospital.
OL,18,FA vigil took place earlier at Kingston
OL,19,FBeach, where the incident took place,
OL,20,Falongside a one-minute silence in
OL,21,FShoreham town centre.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
